              { label: '3. Hard data', body: 'It is <code>C(t)=(&sum;f<sub>k</sub>|X<sub>t</sub>(k)|)/(&sum;|X<sub>t</sub>(k)|)</code> drawn as a curve. Derivatives <code>dC/dt</code> can highlight opening/closing gestures or filter automation.' },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'MOT · spectral motion',
